NOT COVERED BY THE GPL: the key and cassette sounds (Pixabay)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The deck's key clicks and cassette sounds in official Dic2Phone builds are
recordings from Pixabay, trimmed and filtered for this app. They are used
under the Pixabay Content License (https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/)
and are NOT part of this program's GPL license. They may only be used as part
of the app; they may not be extracted, redistributed or reused on their own.

To respect that license they are not included in this repository. The app
loads them, when present, from app/src/main/assets/sounds/ (ignored by git);
without them it plays simple synthesized stand-ins, so builds from source work
and are entirely GPL.

  "Tape Player Sounds"          by AldebaranCW (Freesound), via Pixabay
      https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/tape-player-sounds-90780/
  "Cassette FFWW cassetera"     by koraps (Freesound), via Pixabay
      https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/cassette-ffww-cassetera-96765/
  "Cassette Eject"              by Jurij, via Pixabay
