Made with AI
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Dic2Phone was designed, directed and tested by WolfyD, and much of its code was
written with an AI coding assistant (Claude, by Anthropic). Inside the app, AI
is used only for captions: OpenAI's Whisper model, running on the phone.
